      "text": "衝鋒——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "——是誰在那邊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "呿，你在看哪裡！接招！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "呃啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "text": "整合運動正在我們後方......組織進攻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "他們跟不上我們的速度！繼續衝刺！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜賓",
      "text": "馬上就能離開整合運動控制的區域了！不要停下！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "區區暴徒——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "臨光",
      "text": "怎麼能阻止我們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
